// The public portable contract allows Trap. Only the unselected firmware
// member contains a trap; the selected native compositions must remain usable.
linux_x86_64 machine helper() crashes Trap {}
windows_x86_64 machine helper() crashes Trap {}
macos_arm64 machine helper() crashes Trap {}
linux_arm64 machine helper() crashes Trap {}
uefi_x86_64 machine helper() crashes Trap { crash Trap; }

machine main() crashes Trap { helper(); }
